KAYAKU KABUSHIKI-KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASO, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, KOJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SASO TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANAKA KOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASO, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, KOJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A gas generator for slowly expanding and developing an air bag at the early stage of the development and then rapidly expanding and developing it or emitting a clean gas evenly around a housing.  The gas generator includes a gas generating agent (6) and an igniter (8, 9) in the housing (1). The igniter (9) is disposed eccentrically to the axis (a) of the housing (1). A high temperature gas is generated in a combustion chamber (4) because of the combustion of the gas generating agent (6) ignited by the igniter (9). The pass performance of the high temperature gas through inner tube member (2) closest to the igniter (9) is lower than that through the part other than the inner tube member (2).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un générateur de gaz destiné à un développement et à une expansion lents d'un coussin gonflable au tout début de sa mise en oeuvre, puis à son développement et à son expansion rapides, ou destiné à émettre un gaz propre uniformément autour d'un logement. Le générateur de gaz comprend, dans le logement (1) un agent générateur de gaz (6) et un allumeur (8,9). L'allumeur (9) est disposé de manière excentrique par rapport à l'axe (a) du logement (1). A l'allumage de l'agent générateur de gaz (6) par l'allumeur (9), un gaz à haute température est généré dans une chambre de combustion (4). La performance de passage de ce gaz à haute température à travers l'élément d'un tube intérieur (2) le plus proche de l'allumeur (9) est inférieure à la performance de passage du gaz dans la partie autre que celle constituée par cet élément de tube intérieur (2).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>